# Food and exploration have been one wave with one discount, so how a far frontier trades against a near one, and exploration against food, was fixed by distance alone. Splitting them into two waves with their own horizons — food (appetite-weighted things and smell, confinement-suppressed) with the usual steep discount, exploration (frontier and learned doors, muted behind the agent) with a much slower one — lets the far frontier straight ahead keep its pull over a near frontier at the side, making exploration more ballistic, while nearby food still wins; value is the larger of the two.

# Two waves, two horizons. Food and exploration were one wave with one discount,
# so the trade between a far frontier and a near one was fixed by distance alone.
# Here food (appetite-weighted things, smell) spreads in its own wave with the
# usual 0.94, and exploration (frontier, learned doors, muted behind the agent)
# in a second, slower-decaying wave, so the far frontier ahead keeps its pull over
# the near one at the side; `value` is the larger of the two.
channel source
channel solid
channel free
channel scent
channel thing
channel bad
channel here
channel value
channel trail
channel behind
channel door
channel lure
channel roam
channel foodwave
channel roamwave
channel pass

rule remember_path:
  when 1
  set trail = max(here, 0.995 * trail)

rule spread_behind:
  when 1
  set behind = 0.99 * avg8(behind) + 0.01 * trail

rule find_doors:
  when 1
  set door = solid * clamp(2 * (leak - 0.5), 0, 1) * clamp(sum4(free), 0, 1)

rule passability:
  when 1
  set pass = (1 - solid * (1 - leak)) * (1 - bad)

# Split the senses: what is food, and what is only worth looking at.
rule split_sources:
  when 1
  set lure = where(max(thing, scent) > 0, source, 0) / (1 + 0.5 * sum8(solid))
  set roam = max(where(max(thing, scent) > 0, 0, source), 0.3 * door) * exp(-40 * behind)

rule food_wave:
  when 1
  set foodwave = max(lure, 0.94 * max4(foodwave), 0.916214 * max8(foodwave)) * pass

rule roam_wave:
  when 1
  set roamwave = max(roam, 0.97 * max4(roamwave), 0.957847 * max8(roamwave)) * pass

rule readout:
  when 1
  set value = max(foodwave, roamwave)
